  "applications_text": "Diglycidyl 1,2-cyclohexanedicarboxylate or DCE 142 is a low viscosity cycloaliphatic diepoxy. The cured resins of DCE 142 with carboxylic anhydrides will have excellent mechanical properties, high Tg, high weather/chemical resistance, and superior electrical resistance along with non-yellowing characteristics. DCE 142 is ideal for applications such as coatings, electrical insulation components designed for medium/high voltage, outdoor applications, and high performance/temperature composites.",
  "applications": [
    "Coatings",
    "Electrical insulation components for medium/high voltage",
    "Outdoor applications",
    "High performance/temperature composites"
  ],
